* Process corners for examples/kb/rc-relaxation-oscillator/oscillator.spice.
*
* Self-contained, PDK-free stand-in for a real .lib: the two process knobs
* that actually set this oscillator's period are the timing capacitor value
* and the reference-derived charge current, so each section scales those
* rather than device models. Replace this file with a real PDK model
* library (e.g. sky130's sky130.lib.spice) once the oscillator is built out
* of real devices.

.lib tt
.param corner_cap=1.00
.param corner_iref=1.00
.endl tt

.lib ss
.param corner_cap=1.10
.param corner_iref=0.95
.endl ss

.lib ff
.param corner_cap=0.90
.param corner_iref=1.05
.endl ff
